## Important reassurance

Your ETL stays exact because:

```text
nodes.parquet and edges.parquet are the source of truth.
```

The projection script only does this:

```text
read full nodes
read full edges
filter visible node types
keep selected direct edges
create derived UI edges
write new UI parquet files
```

It does **not** delete, mutate, or overwrite full graph data.

The only collapsed relationships are **display edges** for UI:

```text
ServiceAccount → Subdomain
derived from:
ServiceAccount → DirectoryPerson → Subdomain
```

and:

```text
ServiceAccount → Application
derived from:
ServiceAccount → CI → Application
```

So the backend truth is still preserved.

